{"about_the_game":"Payasos &amp; Balazos is a 2D action-platformer focused on boss battles, with a strong emphasis on comedy. Help Chicl\u00f3n, a freshly graduated clown, become the star of Circo Domingo and uncover the secrets of the mysterious Laughland Island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArm yourself with your bubblegum blaster, dodge explosive pies, jump across treacherous platforms, and face off against enemies with outrageous wigs and way too much makeup.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfaaKey Features:<br />\r\nIntense boss battles with unique and extravagant personalities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA colorful, exaggerated art style inspired by cartoons and circus aesthetics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChallenging platforming with arcade-inspired mechanics and a wide variety of enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbsurd humor, funny dialogues, and ridiculously chaotic situations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginal soundtrack blending rock, circus music, and pure chaos.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to survive the most dangerous circus in the world?<br />\r\nIt\u2019s time to kick some red-nosed butt!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630800?t=1744220947","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630800/744d3b8066774b3513b2ccada15a920acc8a5271/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744220947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630800/cc32f8e6637e1b43e15533824a436e7a57b6c959/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744220947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630800/cc32f8e6637e1b43e15533824a436e7a57b6c959/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744220947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3638370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Payasos &amp; Balazos is a 2D action-platfor